fixture ground_run_speed
doc BUILD.md s5 Ground: "Max run speed 540 u/s (9 u/f)", "Ground acceleration 0 to max in 6 f"
room test/flat
frames 24
input
  0..23 R
end
expect
  # 9 u/f is 2304 sub-pixels; 6 frames to get there is 384 a frame.
  at 0 vx=384 x=200u+384
  at 4 vx=1920
  at 5 vx=2304
  during 5..23 vx=2304 state=ground
  # 1.5+3+4.5+6+7.5 units, then 19 frames at 9 units.
  at 23 x=100736
end
